{"format":"rgate","version":1,"circuit":{"title":"Editable Verilog PWM","root":"main","modules":[{"name":"main","gates":[{"id":1,"name":"clock","kind":"clock","position":{"x":100.0,"y":100.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":100,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":13.0,"y":0.0},"net":1}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":2,"name":"DUTY","kind":"dip","position":{"x":100.0,"y":250.0},"rotation":0,"width":8,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","Low","High"]},"pins":[{"name":"Z","direction":"output","width":8,"offset":{"x":0.0,"y":10.0},"net":2}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":3,"name":"dimmer","kind":{"module":"pwm"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":180.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":-6.0},"net":1},{"name":"duty","direction":"input","width":8,"offset":{"x":-45.0,"y":6.0},"net":2},{"name":"pwm_out","direction":"output","width":1,"offset":{"x":45.0,"y":0.0},"net":3}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":4,"name":"PWM_LED","kind":"led","position":{"x":580.0,"y":180.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[{"name":"I","direction":"input","width":1,"offset":{"x":0.0,"y":7.0},"net":3}],"text":"","show_name":true,"config":{}},{"id":5,"name":"source_instructions","kind":"comment","position":{"x":80.0,"y":360.0},"rotation":0,"width":1,"input_count":2,"delay":1,"period":500,"initial":{"bits":["Low"]},"pins":[],"text":"Editable Verilog PWM. Select pwm in Modules, then Module \u2192 Edit Verilog source.\nRun from main using Icarus. Double-click DUTY for live input; probe pwm_out.\nDouble-click dimmer during simulation to inspect cnt without resetting.","show_name":true,"config":{}}],"nets":[{"id":1,"name":"clk","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":2,"name":"duty","width":8,"show_name":true,"port":null},{"id":3,"name":"pwm_out","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":null}],"wires":[{"id":1,"net":1,"points":[{"x":113.0,"y":100.0},{"x":126.0,"y":100.0},{"x":126.0,"y":174.0},{"x":305.0,"y":174.0}],"start":{"gate":1,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":3,"pin":"clk"}},{"id":2,"net":2,"points":[{"x":100.0,"y":260.0},{"x":100.0,"y":273.0},{"x":288.0,"y":273.0},{"x":288.0,"y":186.0},{"x":305.0,"y":186.0}],"start":{"gate":2,"pin":"Z"},"end":{"gate":3,"pin":"duty"}},{"id":3,"net":3,"points":[{"x":395.0,"y":180.0},{"x":412.0,"y":180.0},{"x":412.0,"y":199.0},{"x":580.0,"y":199.0},{"x":580.0,"y":187.0}],"start":{"gate":3,"pin":"pwm_out"},"end":{"gate":4,"pin":"I"}}]},{"name":"pwm","gates":[],"nets":[{"id":1,"name":"clk","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":2,"name":"duty","width":8,"show_name":true,"port":"input"},{"id":3,"name":"pwm_out","width":1,"show_name":true,"port":"output"},{"id":4,"name":"cnt","width":8,"show_name":true,"port":null}],"wires":[],"verilog":"// Project F: Hello Arty I - Pulse Width Modulation\n// (C)2020 Will Green, open source hardware released under the MIT License\n// Learn more at https://projectf.io\n\n`default_nettype none\n`timescale 1ns / 1ps\n\nmodule pwm (\n    input wire logic clk,\n    input wire logic [7:0] duty,\n    output     logic pwm_out\n    );\n\n    logic [7:0] cnt = 8'b0;\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        cnt <= cnt + 1;\n    end\n\n    always_comb begin\n        pwm_out = (cnt < duty);\n    end\nendmodule\n"}]}}
